WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:13.347 size:53% position:73% line:53%
populaires. Mais après la ventet

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:14.114 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rapidement devenir un

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:14.882 size:53% position:73% line:53%
inconvénient.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.649 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Gilles Veilleux adore

00:00:14.448 --> 00:00:16.450 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'application OnStar, de GM.

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:17.217 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il peut déverrouiller les portes

00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:18.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de sa Cadillac Escalade,

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la démarrer et la géolocaliser

00:00:17.551 --> 00:00:20.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en tout temps. L'été dernier, ie

00:00:19.086 --> 00:00:21.855 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de vendre sa Cadillac et oublie

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.889 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'application.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.924 size:53% position:73% line:53%
GILLES VEILLEUX, ancien

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:24.958 size:53% position:73% line:53%
propriétaire d'une Cadillac

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Moi, j'ai pensé que rendue

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.994 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au concessionnaire,

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:28.028 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que l'application aurait...

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:29.062 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aurait débarqué!

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:30.097 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Par curiosité, il appuie

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:31.131 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur l'icône. L'appli est

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:32.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
toujours active.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- À un moment donné, j'ai cliqué

00:00:31.465 --> 00:00:34.234 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là-dessus, puis oups!

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:35.269 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'ai retrouvé le véhicule.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:36.303 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le véhicule, il s'en allait

00:00:34.568 --> 00:00:37.304 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur une autoroute direction...

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.372 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux États-Unis.

00:00:36.637 --> 00:00:39.373 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est quand même très

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:40.407 size:53% position:73% line:53%
troublant...

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.441 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La titulaire de la Chaire

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.476 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de recherche sur l'intelligence

00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:43.510 size:53% position:73% line:53%
artificielle responsable,

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:44.545 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'Université d'Ottawa,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
y voit une importante brèche

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:46.580 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de sécurité qui peut entraîner

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:47.614 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de graves conséquences.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.649 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CÉLINE CASTETS-RENARD,

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:49.682 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Université d'Ottawa

00:00:47.948 --> 00:00:50.717 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des menaces physiques

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ou des menaces de dévoiler

00:00:50.017 --> 00:00:52.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des informations personnelles,

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.787 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du harcèlement...

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:54.855 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Nous partons à Saint-Louis,

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:55.889 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans le Missouri, à la rencontre

00:00:54.121 --> 00:01:00.260 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du nouveau propriétaire,

00:00:55.155 --> 00:01:00.260 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui ne sait pas que sa vie

00:00:56.223 --> 00:01:00.260 size:53% position:73% line:53%
privée est compromise.

00:01:13.707 --> 00:01:17.044 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Nous proposons de faire

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:20.747 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une démonstration.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:20.747 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pouvez-vous le démarrer?

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.747 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(vrombissement du moteur)

00:01:32.059 --> 00:01:36.663 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 General Motors a refusé

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:36.663 size:53% position:73% line:53%
notre demande d'entrevue,

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.663 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais nous écrit qu'elle...

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.306 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Une procédure dictée

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:47.341 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans les conditions

00:01:45.606 --> 00:01:48.375 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'utilisation de l'appli OnStar.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.376 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est un peu facile de la part

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.410 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des entreprises, des vendeur

00:01:48.709 --> 00:01:57.451 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de se déresponsabiliser,

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:58.952 size:53% position:73% line:53%
finalement, sur la tête

00:01:50.744 --> 00:02:00.487 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du consommateur.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:02.022 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- GM ne fait pas bande à part :

00:01:59.286 --> 00:02:03.557 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'autres fabricants automobiles

00:02:00.821 --> 00:02:05.058 size:53% position:73% line:53%
exigent des conditions

00:02:02.356 --> 00:02:06.593 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'utilisation similaires

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:08.128 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et demandent aux clients

00:02:05.392 --> 00:02:09.663 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de les prévenir dès qu'il y a

00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:11.198 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un changement de propriétaire,

00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:11.698 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une pratique aujourd'hui remise

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:11.698 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en question.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:11.698 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Annie Hudon-F

